  "description": "Resumable uploads for ASP.NET Core over the tus 1.0.0 protocol — a phone upload that drops half way resumes from the last byte the server kept instead of starting again. Speaks to tus-js-client, Uppy, TusDotNetClient and every other tus client. Bodies are streamed to the store, never buffered, and the whole path is trim- and AOT-clean.",
